This repository is an unmodified copy of PayPal's Checkout Ruby SDK, as published in the fork
https://github.com/darkBuddha/Checkout-Ruby-SDK at commit f1aab0f4e367aad1de937bba6cbc4abb22900339.

Neither that fork nor the upstream repository https://github.com/paypal/Checkout-Ruby-SDK is available
anymore, so Codeur keeps this copy to install the gem. The code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE); copyright remains with its original authors.
